BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://inprinthouston.org
 /wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LeslieArchibaldFFPRS-INSTA.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://inprinthouston.org/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/06/LeslieArchibaldFFPRS-INSTA.jpg
UID:TjHnkWNWx-Dz4z222TkHw
SUMMARY:First Fridays Presents Leslie Archibald
DTSTAMP:20260705T141637Z
DTSTART:20260710T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Free and open to the public \nDoors @ 7 pm\nPop-up poet @ 7:30 
	pm\nFeatured poet @ 7:40 pm\nOpen mic @ 8:15 pm \nInprint is proud to serv
	e as the host for the First Fridays Reading Series. The First Fridays Read
	ing Series is the oldest poetry series in Houston and was organized by Rob
	ert Clark from 1975-2019. Today\, First Fridays events are curated and hos
	ted by local community members. \nThe July featured reader will be Leslie 
	Archibald\, a Houston-based writer. When she is not writing\, you may find
	 her photographing Houston’s unique character or dabbling in watercolors. 
	Her visual and literary works appear in anthologies\, lit magazines\, and 
	Houston galleries. Her chapbook Poems for a Broken 𝙼̶𝚊̶𝚛̶𝚛̶𝚒̶𝚊̶𝚐̶𝚎̶ Man (F
	inishing Line Press) is now available. Learn more about Leslie at lesliear
	chibaldwriter.com or @leslie.archibald. \nThe opening pop-up poet will be 
	Margo Davis\, author of the recent poetry collection Uncoupling (Lamar Uni
	versity Press\, 2026). Her poems appear in local outstanding journals such
	 as equinox and Synkroniciti\, as well as The Arkansas Review\, Deep South
	\, and Mackinaw Journal. Forthcoming poems will appear in The MacGuffin\, 
	as well as a series for The Ekphrastic Review. Her photographs have appear
	ed in Barcelona galleries and several journals\, and are forthcoming in Fl
	yway. Margo resides in Houston but still thinks of herself as a New Orlean
	ian. \nFor more information about the First Fridays Reading Series\, click
	 here. To join the First Fridays Facebook group\, click here. \n\n\nhttps:
	//inprinthouston.org/event/first-fridays-presents-leslie-archibald/\n\nFro
	m Inprint Houston
URL:https://inprinthouston.org/event/first-fridays-presents-leslie-archibal
	d/
LOCATION:Inprint House\, 1520 W Main St\, Houston\, TX\, 77006\, United Sta
	tes
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:inprint-houston
CATEGORIES:Inprint Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
