UID:F1lgj5yKBJdZoC6qTpDx4
SUMMARY:INPRINT BOOK CLUB DISCUSSES SON OF NOBODY
DTSTAMP:20260705T141637Z
DTSTART:20260719T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:This Inprint Book Club meeting will take place via Zoom. The Zo
	om link will be the same for every meeting and will be provided in your Ev
	entbrite email receipt (scroll down to the Additional Information section)
	. \n \nOn July 19\, 2026 the Inprint Book Club will discuss the novel Son 
	of Nobody by Yann Martel\, who will appear as part of the 2025/2026 Inprin
	t Margarett Root Brown Reading Series on Monday\, April 27\, 2026. Visit b
	razosbookstore.com to order your copy of Martel’s newest novel. \nInprint 
	Book Club meetings are free and open to the public and are facilitated by 
	experienced book club leader Torie Ludwin. The full schedule of Inprint Bo
	ok Club meetings for 2025/2026 season appears on the main Inprint Book Clu
	b webpage\, which you can access by clicking here. \nIf you have any furth
	er questions\, please email info@inprint.org. \n\n\nhttps://inprinthouston
	.org/event/inprint-book-club-discusses-son-of-nobody/\n\nFrom Inprint Hous
	ton
URL:https://inprinthouston.org/event/inprint-book-club-discusses-son-of-nob
	ody/
LOCATION:TX
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:inprint-houston
CATEGORIES:Inprint Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
